@startuml F3.5-D02-aprovar-formativa
title F3.5-D02 — Aprovar formativa individual
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "FormativeController" as Ctrl
participant "ApproveFormativeUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Aprovar (horasValidadas)
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /formativas/{id}/aprovar
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE APROVADA\n+ event_log\n+ certificado\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: formativa APROVADA

@enduml
